<header><p class="enc-kicker"><a href="/encyclopedia/conflicts/20th-century">Conflicts &amp; Resolutions</a> · War</p><h1 class="enc-title">Irish War of Independence</h1><p class="enc-meta"><span class="dates"><a href="/years/1919">1919</a>–<a href="/years/1921">1921</a></span> · <a href="/centuries/20th-century">20th century</a> · Also known as Anglo-Irish War</p></header>
<div class="enc-body"><p class="enc-desc">The Irish War of Independence was a <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/guerrilla-warfare">guerrilla</a> war fought by the Irish Republican Army against British forces in Ireland. It followed <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/sinn-fein">Sinn Féin</a>'s election victory and the declaration of independence by <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/dail-eireann">Dáil Éireann</a> in 1919. A truce in July 1921 led to the <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/anglo-irish-treaty">Anglo-Irish Treaty</a>, which created the Irish Free State.</p><figure class="enc-fig"><img src="/images/encyclopedia/irish-war-of-independence.jpg" alt="Irish War of Independence" width="320" height="176" fetchpriority="high"><figcaption>Image: Unknown author · Public domain · <a href="https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Hogan%27s_Flying_Column.gif" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Wikimedia Commons</a></figcaption></figure></div>
